e let us know so we can adjust as needed.</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Reason:</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:38.25pt; text-indent:-.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Symbol\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Upgrade to existing filled FTE - leadership has a candidate in mind </p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Position type: new add</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Please let us know if there are any questions, we are happy to help.</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Title: </b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Ambulatory Trainer/Instructor</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>PL/CC/JC</b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>18/9540/1180</b></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:16.55pt\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height:16.55pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Grade: </b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height:16.55pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">13</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Salary Range:</b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">$19.51 - $29.27</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>FLSA: </b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Non-exempt (hourly)</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>PPT Level:</b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">22 day</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>License: </b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">None</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>FTE Leader:</b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">No</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Direct Supervision: </b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">None</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>FTE Hours:</b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">1.00</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Reports to:</b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Director of Ambulatory Informatics</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Job Description Status:</b> </p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">In progress, information below</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Position Summary:</b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"\">The Ambulatory Trainer/Instructor provides initial and ongoing training and support to medical office staff for the EMR (Epic), as well as operational workflows. They coordinate the BLS Program/certification for Medical Partners new hires and perform staff competency assessments as needed. The Ambulatory Trainer/Instructor also provides on-site support for onboarding of new practices and serves as a resource for annual reporting of Quality data. </li></ul><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b>&nbsp;</b></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Education:</b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xmsolistparagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">High School Diploma or equivalent is required.</li><li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"\">Associate’s or Bachelor’s degree is strongly preferred.</li></ul><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>License and/or certification:</b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"\">Certification as a BLS Instructor is required.</li><li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"\">Must obtain Epic Credentialed Trainer status within 60 days of hire.</li></ul><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b>&nbsp;</b></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Experience:</b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"\">Three (3) years of experience with an electronic medical record required; Epic preferred.</li><li class=\"xmsolistparagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Three (3) years of experience working in an ambulatory healthcare setting with an in-depth knowledge of either front office processes (registration, insurance, etc) or clinical processes required.</li><li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"\">Experience using Microsoft Office, particularly Word, Powerpoint and Excel is required.</li><li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"\">Previous experience in training, instruction or adult learning a plus.</li></ul><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Schedule:</b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"\">Primarily day shift, Monday through Friday</li><li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"\">Evenings and weekends may be required as needed.</li></ul><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><a id=\"OWAAM8B69DE59A20F4959A6193DFA2135045C\" href=\"mailto:Rachel.Bomar@tidalhealth.org\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@Rachel Bomar</span></a> please let me know if you need any more information. </p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Thanks,</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Erin Cowder</b></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Compensation Analyst</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">People Department</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Tidal Health</b></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>tidalhealth.org</b></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><i>&nbsp;</i></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></body></html>","bodyType":"html"}